{"timestamp": "2026-10-08T05:54:04.427583+00:00", "telemetry_type": "PHASE3_HYBRID", "phase": "PHASE_3B_HYBRID", "phase3_run": "3B", "plan_version": "v2.3", "gcp_project_id": "openclaw-sandbox-env", "gcp_location": "us-central1", "sales_agent_model": "gemini-2.5-pro", "gatekeeper_model": "see mock log", "agent_roster": [{"agent_id": "1", "role": "Strategist"}, {"agent_id": "2", "role": "SME"}, {"agent_id": "3", "role": "Persona Proxy"}], "voting_method": "majority", "director_ai": "ONLINE", "monitor_ai": "ONLINE", "five_pillar_engine": "ONLINE", "tier3_hard_gate": "ONLINE", "atomic_purge": "OFFLINE", "red_team": "OFFLINE", "max_outbound_chars": 1000, "event": "DEBATE_PROPOSAL", "agent_id": "1", "role": "Strategist", "proposal_text": "We appreciate that and work exclusively with funds that have a strong in-house team. That perspective leads to a hypothesis: even with a great team, does your analyst workload during surges in deal flow ever delay diligence on secondary or opportunistic targets?\n\nWe provide on-demand, supplemental research to help leading funds cover more ground without diverting focus from their highest-priority deals. This allows your team to focus on what they do best, ensuring no promising opportunity is left on the back burner due to bandwidth constraints.\n\nA brief call could clarify how we provide this supplemental support."}
{"timestamp": "2026-10-08T05:54:30.137252+00:00", "telemetry_type": "PHASE3_HYBRID", "phase": "PHASE_3B_HYBRID", "phase3_run": "3B", "plan_version": "v2.3", "gcp_project_id": "openclaw-sandbox-env", "gcp_location": "us-central1", "sales_agent_model": "gemini-2.5-pro", "gatekeeper_model": "see mock log", "agent_roster": [{"agent_id": "1", "role": "Strategist"}, {"agent_id": "2", "role": "SME"}, {"agent_id": "3", "role": "Persona Proxy"}], "voting_method": "majority", "director_ai": "ONLINE", "monitor_ai": "ONLINE", "five_pillar_engine": "ONLINE", "tier3_hard_gate": "ONLINE", "atomic_purge": "OFFLINE", "red_team": "OFFLINE", "max_outbound_chars": 1000, "event": "GEMINI_CALL_USAGE", "prompt_tokens": 486, "candidates_tokens": 239, "total_tokens": 2851, "model_version": "gemini-2.5-pro"}
{"timestamp": "2026-10-08T05:54:30.137737+00:00", "telemetry_type": "PHASE3_HYBRID", "phase": "PHASE_3B_HYBRID", "phase3_run": "3B", "plan_version": "v2.3", "gcp_project_id": "openclaw-sandbox-env", "gcp_location": "us-central1", "sales_agent_model": "gemini-2.5-pro", "gatekeeper_model": "see mock log", "agent_roster": [{"agent_id": "1", "role": "Strategist"}, {"agent_id": "2", "role": "SME"}, {"agent_id": "3", "role": "Persona Proxy"}], "voting_method": "majority", "director_ai": "ONLINE", "monitor_ai": "ONLINE", "five_pillar_engine": "ONLINE", "tier3_hard_gate": "ONLINE", "atomic_purge": "OFFLINE", "red_team": "OFFLINE", "max_outbound_chars": 1000, "event": "DEBATE_PROPOSAL", "agent_id": "2", "role": "SME", "proposal_text": "It's a significant advantage to have a strong in-house team. Our goal is to provide supplemental research capacity, not replace proven talent. When deal flow surges, does your team ever face a backlog where promising, but not top-tier, opportunities risk getting sidelined? We help funds cover those without distracting their core analysts.\n\nRegarding your question on our technical diligence for tokenomics, this is a core component of our 6-Pillar Framework. We analyze it three ways:\n\n1.  **Emission & Vesting Modeling:** We map the complete token release schedule against all vesting cliffs (team, investors, treasury) to quantitatively forecast periods of high potential sell-pressure.\n\n2.  **Value Accrual Mechanism:** We dissect how the token captures protocol value. Is it direct (e.g., fee-sharing, burns) or indirect (governance)? We then assess the sustainability of that mechanism.\n\n3.  **Economic Sink vs. Faucet Analysis:** We map all inflationary sources (\"faucets\") against all value-locking or deflationary mechanics (\"sinks\"). A healthy model requires sinks that can scale to absorb the faucets long-term."}
{"timestamp": "2026-10-08T05:54:44.609073+00:00", "telemetry_type": "PHASE3_HYBRID", "phase": "PHASE_3B_HYBRID", "phase3_run": "3B", "plan_version": "v2.3", "gcp_project_id": "openclaw-sandbox-env", "gcp_location": "us-central1", "sales_agent_model": "gemini-2.5-pro", "gatekeeper_model": "see mock log", "agent_roster": [{"agent_id": "1", "role": "Strategist"}, {"agent_id": "2", "role": "SME"}, {"agent_id": "3", "role": "Persona Proxy"}], "voting_method": "majority", "director_ai": "ONLINE", "monitor_ai": "ONLINE", "five_pillar_engine": "ONLINE", "tier3_hard_gate": "ONLINE", "atomic_purge": "OFFLINE", "red_team": "OFFLINE", "max_outbound_chars": 1000, "event": "GEMINI_CALL_USAGE", "prompt_tokens": 479, "candidates_tokens": 116, "total_tokens": 1966, "model_version": "gemini-2.5-pro"}
{"timestamp": "2026-10-08T05:54:44.609742+00:00", "telemetry_type": "PHASE3_HYBRID", "phase": "PHASE_3B_HYBRID", "phase3_run": "3B", "plan_version": "v2.3", "gcp_project_id": "openclaw-sandbox-env", "gcp_location": "us-central1", "sales_agent_model": "gemini-2.5-pro", "gatekeeper_model": "see mock log", "agent_roster": [{"agent_id": "1", "role": "Strategist"}, {"agent_id": "2", "role": "SME"}, {"agent_id": "3", "role": "Persona Proxy"}], "voting_method": "majority", "director_ai": "ONLINE", "monitor_ai": "ONLINE", "five_pillar_engine": "ONLINE", "tier3_hard_gate": "ONLINE", "atomic_purge": "OFFLINE", "red_team": "OFFLINE", "max_outbound_chars": 1000, "event": "DEBATE_PROPOSAL", "agent_id": "3", "role": "Persona Proxy", "proposal_text": "Thank you for the opportunity. We respect the value of a strong in-house team; our service is designed to augment, not replace, such talent.\n\nThis leads to a question: during periods of intense deal flow, does your analysts' workload result in a diligence backlog, potentially delaying the assessment of otherwise promising opportunities?\n\nWe provide supplemental research capacity for crypto funds, helping them manage overflow and ensure comprehensive market coverage without over-extending their core team. Our process is built on a structured 6-Pillar DD Framework to ensure consistent, high-quality analysis."}
